## Development Workflow

This repository uses DevFlow and GSD workflow standards.

- **Tasks**: Managed via \`mise\` (\`mise tasks\`).
- **Memory & Context**: Automatically integrated with **Memtrace** (bi-temporal memory daemon) and **MemPalace** (\`.planning/.mempalace-stage\`).
- **Syncing Environment**:
  - Pull personal environment: \`mise run sync:env\`
  - Push back changes: \`mise run push:env\`
- **Worktree-Isolated Tasks**: \`mise run start:wt <type> <issue-number> <slug>\`
